check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9796057Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9805232Z ^[[0m
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9806114Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9807031Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9807394Z 
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9807640Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9808206Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9809273Z 
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9809594Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9810221Z    if you are ready to continue.
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9810433Z 
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9811059Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9811726Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9812667Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9813236Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9813534Z 
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9813754Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9814076Z 
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9814385Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9814949Z    can use Nix.
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9815163Z 
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9815440Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9815712Z 
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9816219Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9816814Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9817473Z 
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9817759Z I will:
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9818015Z 
check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:45.9818250Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
