conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.3957647Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.3965811Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4059358Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4069962Z ^[[0m
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4070643Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4071197Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4071529Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4071778Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4072399Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4073295Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4073590Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4074081Z    if you are ready to continue.
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4074443Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4075257Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4076252Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4076854Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4077266Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4077477Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4077671Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4078091Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4078324Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4078974Z    can use Nix.
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4079160Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4079399Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4079614Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4080076Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4080745Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4081176Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4081324Z I will:
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4081531Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4081742Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4082259Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4082801Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4083234Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4083671Z  - install Nix in /nix
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4084002Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4084491Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4085455Z    /root
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4096446Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4097302Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4107080Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4107763Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4108062Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4108777Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4109498Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4127080Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4128428Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4137663Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4138352Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4139018Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4139255Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4139568Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4139832Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4140160Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4140614Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4140919Z 
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4141086Z If you would like to
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4141527Z see the output, try like this:
conformance-external (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:41.4141746Z 
