conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.3972466Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4057482Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4066544Z ^[[0m
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4067196Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4067891Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4068183Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4068506Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4069085Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4069448Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4069722Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4070604Z    if you are ready to continue.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4070970Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4071622Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4072314Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4072979Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4073711Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4073903Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4074128Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4074468Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4074708Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4075192Z    can use Nix.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4075371Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4075485Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4075736Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4079895Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4080652Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4086213Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4086777Z I will:
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4087102Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4087425Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4087914Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4088562Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4089060Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4089808Z  - install Nix in /nix
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4090221Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4090700Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4091566Z    /root
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4099719Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4100426Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4108865Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4109494Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:40.4109953Z 
